# @name: openssl | Decrypt File with AES
# @description: Decrypts a file encrypted with AES-256-CBC Group: Encryption and Decryption. Template: replace placeholders before running. {input_file} = Input encrypted file [default "input.enc"] | {output_file} = Output decrypted file [default "output.txt"]
openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -in {input_file} -out {output_file}